From: Kurt Fuchs <contact@fuchskurt.eu>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:04:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] add crabefi-varstore-gen

Host tool that builds a read-only EDK2 variable store holding PK, KEK, db
(optional dbx) from vendor .auth files plus SecureBootEnable=1, serialized
with CrabEFI's own EDK2 writer and re-parsed before it is written.
